onents include AMP\K, Ras, Raf, MEK, ERK, RSK, PI3K, Akt, TSC1/2, Rheb, mTORC1, and mTORC2. The chart highlights the roles of GTP and GDP in the pathway, with mTORC1 and mTORC2 complexes influencing cellular outcomes.)/K 0/P 16565 0 R/Pg 188 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj16640 0 obj<</K[1 3]/P 16565 0 R/Pg 188 0 R/S/Caption/Type/StructElem>>endobj16641 0 obj<</K 4/P 16565 0 R/Pg 188 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj16642 0 obj<</K[5 18509 0 R 7 18510 0 R 9]/P 16565 0 R/Pg 188 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj16643 0 obj<</K[10 18499 0 R 12 18500 0 R]/P 16565 0 R/Pg 188 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj16644 0 obj<</K 5/P 16565 0 R/Pg 192 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj16645 0 obj<</K 6/P 16565 0 R/Pg 192 0 R/S/H3/Type/StructElem>>endobj16646 0 obj<</K[7 18496 0 R 9]/P 16565 0 R/Pg 192 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj16647 0 obj<</K[10 18490 0 R 12 18491 0 R 14]/P 16565 0 R/Pg 192 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj16648 0 obj<</K 15/P 16565 0 R/Pg 192 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj16649 0 obj<</K 0/P 16565 0 R/Pg 195 0 R/S/H3/Type/StructElem>>endobj16650 0 obj<</K[1 18487 0 R 3]/P 16565 0 R/Pg 195 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj16651 0 obj<</K[4 18481 0 R 6 18482 0 R 8]/P 16565 0 R/Pg 195 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj16652 0 obj<</K[9 18475 0 R 11 18476 0 R 13]/P 16565 0 R/Pg 195 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj16653 0 obj<</K 14/P 16565 0 R/Pg 195 0 R/S/H3/Type/StructElem>>endobj16654 0 obj<</K[15 18472 0 R 17]/P 16565 0 R/Pg 195 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj16655 0 obj<</K[18 18468 0 R]/P 16565 0 R/Pg 195 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj16656 0 obj<</K[3 18465 0 R 5]/P 16565 0 R/Pg 198 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj16657 0 obj<</K 6/P 16565 0 R/Pg 198 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj16658 0 obj<</K 7/P 16565 0 R/Pg 198 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj16659 0 obj<</K[8 18456 0 R 10 18457 0 R 12 18458 0 R 14]/P 16565 0 R/Pg 198 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj16660 0 obj<</K[15 18447 0 R 17 18448 0 R 19 1